    {
      "id": 16,
      "title": "Read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Counters restart with the app process. Queue and budget gauges read durable SQLite state. Missing GPU or Collector series are **unmeasured**, not zero. Explore the provisioned Tempo and Loki sources for traces and sanitized lifecycle logs. Never add prompts, media, team IDs, or credentials as labels.\n\nGPU budget gauges apportion request time only; instance startup, idle time and storage need a separate billing record."
      }
